 "notes": "Body mist: Bath & Body Works SKU list trimmed to icons (Japanese Cherry Blossom archetype with Forever Cherry Blossom as version; Champagne Toast, Warm Vanilla Sugar etc. kept in m); dropped seasonal/limited BBW names (Amber Era, At the Beach, Coastal Dreaming, Midnight Rouge, Orchid Effect, Platinum, Trace Of Blue, Twisted Peppermint, Vanilla Bean Noel, Viva Vanilla). Love Spell (Victoria's Secret) left out: no retrievable source (Parfumo/retailers blocked). Gisou has no brand entry (only a retailer page retrieved). Diptyque solids and hair mists are listed as versions under format archetypes here; the merge step may relink them to Diptyque scent archetypes in fine fragrance. Collectible solid-perfume compacts belong in Bottles & atomisers. Rollerball kind is new (sourced to Fragrenza format guide); no archetypes."
